an","Vandith Pamuru","Yaroslav Rosokha"],"y":2023,"c":"pub","j":"Information Systems Research","v":"34","i":"4","p":"1437-1454","r":90,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1287/isre.2022.1187","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1287/isre.2022.1187"},{"t":"Mixed Strategies in the Indefinitely Repeated Prisoner's Dilemma","a":["Julian Romero","Yaroslav Rosokha"],"y":2023,"c":"pub","j":"Econometrica","v":"91","i":"6","p":"2295-2331","r":1,"l":"https://doi.org/10.3982/ecta17482","lt":"pub","doi":"10.3982/ecta17482"},{"t":"Learning under uncertainty with multiple priors: experimental investigation","a":["James R. Bland","Yaroslav Rosokha"],"y":2021,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Risk and Uncertainty","v":"62","i":"2","p":"157-176","r":67,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11166-021-09351-y","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1007/s11166-021-09351-y"},{"t":"Motivating Innovation: The Effect of Loss Aversion on the Willingness to Persist","a":["Yaroslav Rosokha","Kenneth Younge"],"y":2020,"c":"pub","j":"Review of Economics and Statistics","v":"102","i":"3","p":"569-582","r":13,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1162/rest_a_00846","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1162/rest_a_00846"},{"t":"The Evolution of Cooperation: The Role of Costly Strategy Adjustments","a":["Julian Romero","Yaroslav Rosokha"],"y":2019,"c":"pub","j":"American Economic Journal: Microeconomics","v":"11","i":"1","p":"299-328","r":9,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1257/mic.20160220","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1257/mic.20160220"},{"t":"Constructing strategies in the indefinitely repeated prisoner’s dilemma game","a":["Julian Romero","Yaroslav Rosokha"],"y":2018,"c":"pub","j":"European Economic Review","v":"104","p":"185-219","r":51,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.euroecorev.2018.02.008","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.euroecorev.2018.02.008"},{"t":"Humans Are Not Machines: The Behavioral Impact of Queueing Design on Service Time","a":["Masha Shunko","Julie Niederhoff","Yaroslav Rosokha"],"y":2018,"c":"pub","j":"Management Science","v":"64","i":"1","p":"453-473","r":109,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1287/